MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo Show feels useful alongside my Fire TV devices because its screen could let me view compatible camera feeds, adding something beyond voice control.",
    "The Blink bundle connects directly to my recent XT2 purchase and could help cover my doorway and additional areas if the devices work together."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Another HD Fire TV Stick adds little when I already have a 4K stick and a Fire TV television; familiarity alone does not make it a useful next purchase.",
    "The SSD and enclosure assume a computer upgrade or storage project I have not shown interest in, while the earbuds and lighting kit serve needs I do not currently have."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in Fire TV and cameras seems to have been stretched into interest in almost any Alexa device, even when several offer overlapping functions.",
    "Buying electronics seems to have been treated as a reason to suggest computer parts and phone accessories without a connection to what I am trying to do."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "What I already own matters: I am more interested in adding a useful capability or extending camera coverage than duplicating streaming or voice-control features.",
    "Accessories need a specific purpose and confirmed compatibility; an HDMI cable can fit my setup without being something I need now, and a Blink expansion still needs a compatibility check."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions recognize my connected-home and television interests but miss the difference between a useful extension, a duplicate device, and an unrelated electronics purchase."
}
